@startuml
title Grab transfer state

legend
| # | Meaning |
| D | Destination path known |
| S | File size known |
| O | Server options known (Accept-Ranges) |
| R | Resume supported (Accept-Ranges) |
| Z | Local file empty or missing |
| P | Local file partially complete |
endlegend

[*] --> Empty
[*] --> D
[*] --> S
[*] --> DS

Empty : Filename: ""
Empty : Size: 0
Empty --> O : HEAD: Method not allowed
Empty --> DSO : HEAD: Range not supported
Empty --> DSOR : HEAD: Range supported

DS : Filename: "foo.bar"
DS : Size: > 0
DS --> DSZ : checkExisting(): File missing
DS --> DSP : checkExisting(): File partial
DS --> [*] : checkExisting(): File complete
DS --> ERROR

S : Filename: ""
S : Size: > 0
S --> SO : HEAD: Method not allowed
S --> DSO : HEAD: Range not supported
S --> DSOR : HEAD: Range supported

D : Filename: "foo.bar"
D : Size: 0
D --> DO : HEAD: Method not allowed
D --> DSO : HEAD: Range not supported
D --> DSOR : HEAD: Range supported


O : Filename: ""
O : Size: 0
O : CanResume: false
O --> DSO : GET 200
O --> ERROR

SO : Filename: ""
SO : Size: > 0
SO : CanResume: false
SO --> DSO : GET: 200
SO --> ERROR

DO : Filename: "foo.bar"
DO : Size: 0
DO : CanResume: false
DO --> DSO : GET 200
DO --> ERROR

DSZ : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSZ : Size: > 0
DSZ : File: empty
DSZ --> DSORZ : HEAD: Range supported
DSZ --> DSOZ : HEAD 405 or Range unsupported

DSP : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSP : Size: > 0
DSP : File: partial
DSP --> DSORP : HEAD: Range supported
DSP --> DSOZ : HEAD: 405 or Range unsupported

DSO : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSO : Size: > 0
DSO : CanResume: false
DSO --> DSOZ : checkExisting(): File partial|missing
DSO --> [*] : checkExisting(): File complete

DSOR : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSOR : Size: > 0
DSOR : CanResume: true
DSOR --> DSORP : CheckLocal: File partial
DSOR --> DSORZ : CheckLocal: File missing

DSORP : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSORP : Size: > 0
DSORP : CanResume: true
DSORP : File: partial
DSORP --> Planning

DSORZ : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSORZ : Size: > 0
DSORZ : CanResume: true
DSORZ : File: empty
DSORZ --> Planning

DSOZ : Filename: "foo.bar"
DSOZ : Size: > 0
DSOZ : CanResume: false
DSOZ : File: empty
DSOZ --> Planning

Planning : Decide which byte ranges remain to be downloaded
Planning : RangeSize == 0, or Range unsupported, or Size <= RangeSize:
Planning :   one range covering the rest of the file
Planning : Otherwise: RangeSize sized ranges, minus those a
Planning :   matching checkpoint records as already complete
Planning --> [*] : Checkpoint accounts for every range
Planning --> Transferring

Transferring : Concurrency ranges in flight, dispatched from the
Transferring :   start of the file. A split transfer checkpoints
Transferring :   each range as it completes
Transferring --> [*]
Transferring --> ERROR

ERROR : Something went wrong
ERROR --> [*]

@enduml